nd also used for Hong Kong and Macau. If your Steam language is set to Traditional Chinese, the game picks it automatically, or choose it under Options > Language. ReplaysPlayer's View (G). Watch a replay through the player's own camera. The view holds on each cut, then glides to the next one just before it's made. Branch View at Cut (V). ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T13:14:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039603","verified_at":"2026-10-24T14:57:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5315910-1846651706691632","game_id":"steam-5315910","kind":"update","title":"Hasami: Moonlight Trim is in Steam Next Fest, with a demo update","summary":"Hasami: Moonlight Trim is in Steam Next Fest, with a demo update Hasami: Moonlight Trim is a cozy tree-pruning game set in a moonlit Japanese garden. Draw a line across a branch and everything it crosses falls into the pond. Find the right angle, tie limbs aside with ropes, let good cuts buy new growth, and clean each tree down to its blossom. The free demo is playable all through Steam Next Fest, October 19 to 26. It has five trees from the full game, online leaderboards where every score keeps","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:11:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691632","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5315910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:31:48Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:31:47Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5315910":"2026-10-26T09:31:48Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5315910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:31:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:31:47Z","status":"ok"